Bug fix (layout destruction when AI loads):
- style.css: Changed section:has(.loading-circle) → section:has(> article > .loading-circle) so the full-viewport centering rule only fires for top-level page loaders, not for loading circles inside fixed modals.

Difficulty rating widget colors:
- Added .dr-btn-easy (green), .dr-btn-medium (orange), .dr-btn-hard (red) CSS classes with dark mode variants, applied to the post review popup buttons.

"Did you know?" moved to dropdown:
- Removed the always-visible funfacts-inline section from the page body.
- Added "Věděl jsi, že…?" button to both top and bottom dropdowns.
- When clicked, shows a styled panel (.funfacts-panel) with a close button.

Inline rewrite (instead of popup):
- Removed <GradeRewriter> modal component.
- "Přepsat pro ročník" in the dropdown now opens an inline panel above the article with grade/style buttons.
- Selected rewrite replaces article content in-place with a label and "Zpět na originál" button. Uses a custom .rewrite-spinner (not .loading-circle) to avoid triggering the layout rule.

Exercises collapsible:
- All interactive exercises now start collapsed by default (empty HashSet<int> _expandedExercises).
